OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure as roundabout upgrade
OL,4,Awork continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists will face a six-week road
OL,7,Fclosure as work continues to upgrade a
OL,8,Fbusy roundabout in Hull.
OL,10,FHolwell Road, from the Wawne Road/Bude
OL,11,FRoad roundabout to the
OL,12,FBransholme/Honiton Road roundabout,
OL,13,Fwill be closed southbound from 5
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FHull City Council said the work would
OL,17,Fallow contractors to widen the
OL,18,Fcarriageway and improve traffic flows
OL,19,Fat the Kingswood roundabout.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
