OL,3,GNEWSARoad closure as roundabout upgrade
OL,4,Awork continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Ieronimo said: "We
OL,7,Ffully appreciate how frustrating
OL,8,Froadworks can be, but these
OL,9,Fimprovements are an investment in
OL,10,FKingswood's future and will make sure
OL,11,Fthat the area can meet any future
OL,12,Fdemand placed on the network."
